control).\n- `node harness/src/cli.mjs validate --spec …` — `Spec is valid`; `… run --dry-run` — `pass` (run against a temporary base ref so the changed-path ownership gate actually executed; temp repo removed).\n- Credential scan over the 6 files — 0 hits; `sha256sum -c docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/S07-SHA256SUMS` — all OK.\n\n**Notes / residuals**\n- This isolated workspace has no `node_modules` and no `.git`; I temporarily linked the reference checkout's modules and a scratch git repo to run the real gates, then removed both. `comms:replay`/`comms:compare` were not run (they require a git HEAD identity), and the full uncached typecheck was not run; both are recorded in `s07-acceptance.json` as `notRun`, not claimed as passing.\n- No network use, no dependency install, no loops, no product-lock/default changes; the hidden oracle test was not inspected or modified."}}
